# No provider credentials are configured. Never put secrets in NEXT_PUBLIC variables.
# Development preview is enabled by next dev. Production preview is disabled by default.
# DEVPULSE_REVIEW_MODE=1 is only for an explicitly local review of a production build.
# CR001 bridge credentials/key live outside the repo; use SETUP-AKSES-PORTOFOLIO.bat.
# DEVPULSE_CREATOR_URL is the public creator URL, configured on the personal app.
# DEVPULSE_CREATOR_ORIGIN is a trusted origin on the creator app if its local port changes.
# Never put the hidden personal destination or a real code/key into this public template.
